    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "In a market of soul path Gu, Fang Yuan looks only at Gu that refine the soul. There are no rank four of that kind, but a bunch of rank three, including divine soul Gu among many others. These Gu refine the soul and each has a unique use; for example, refining into ice soul later boosts ice type Gu, and cloud spirit or wind spirit work the same way for their types.",
        "chapters": [
          442
        ],
