  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan notes that even without Luo Po Valley, other soul path Gu worms can replace it. Divine soul Gu, dragon soul Gu, ice soul Gu, dream soul Gu, moon soul Gu, general soul Gu, grudge soul Gu, poem soul Gu and others can refine his soul and let him keep strengthening it toward hundred man soul, thousand man soul, or even ten thousand man soul. He will not take such Gu from Immortal Crane Sect, because Gu used directly on the soul are too dangerous if tampered with, and he knows little of their recipes.",
        "chapters": [
          422
        ],
